en source screenshot cases, gate separation, fallback copy, and no scoring-readiness overclaim.\n- Checked-in artifacts under `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/` for the handoff manifest, validator result, and readback.\n\n## Scope Boundary\n\nThe manifest explicitly records structured/native post-attempt review as the primary UI contract. Official MS screenshots are optional evidence drawer content only when accepted and rights/display eligible; they are forbidden as the default answer review card, above structured mark points, inside the default answer review card, or as the first visible object after submission.\n\nCandidate, rights-unconfirmed, rights-blocked, and quality-blocked source screenshots are explicitly hidden from student display. Missing or blocked source image assets do not block the student's post-attempt review payload.\n\nThis PR performs no full frontend UI integration, no production Supabase mutation, no production RAG reindex, no vector mutation, and no official scoring or Smart Mark readiness claim.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-review-payload-frontend-handoff.test.js` PASS, 4 tests.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-review-payload-frontend-handoff.mjs` PASS, `validator_status: pass`, `check_fail_count: 0`.\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-review-payload-frontend-handoff.mjs` PASS.\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-review-payload-frontend-handoff.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-review-payload-frontend-handoff.test.js` PASS.\n- `git diff --check` PASS.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` exit 0; final run reported a clean worktree, branch synced to `origin/feat/issue-1438`, and only the existing branch ownership warning.\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T22:40:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T22:48:34Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T22:48:34Z","merged_at":"2026-07-07T22:48:34Z","